; The gunner's sight, and the only way the tank is seen from inside it.
;
; Hung off Gun rather than off Turret, which is not a detail: there is no
; crosshair while you are aboard -- the HUD takes it away -- so the barrel is
; the aim, and a view that did not pitch with the barrel would leave the gun
; pointing somewhere the picture never showed. On the gun, where you look is
; where it shoots.
;
; Sat above the mantlet (0.54 tall, so its top is 0.27) and ahead of its face,
; because a camera inside its own armour looks at the inside of its own armour.
[node name="CameraMount" type="Node3D" parent="Turret/Gun"]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.44, -0.3)

[node name="Camera3D" type="Camera3D" parent="Turret/Gun/CameraMount"]
current = false

; Where the driver is put back down on getting out.
; Where the driver's body actually rides. Inside the hull, which the collider
; puts at x -1.4..1.4 and y 0..1.5 -- a soldier parked outside that box is a
; soldier in the open with a tank next to him, and every bot on the field has a
; clear line to his chest. That is what this used to be: it sat at x 2.2, eight
; tenths of a metre clear of the armour.
[node name="Seat" type="Marker3D" parent="."]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.2, 0)

; And where he is put down when he climbs out, which has to be the opposite:
; clear of the hull, or he is dropped inside his own collider. The two were one
; marker, and could not be right for both.
